Condition : 5 - If the premises is operating as a Class E(a) Display or retail sale of goods, other than hot food or E(d) Indoor sport, recreation or fitness (not involving motorised vehicles or firearms or use as a swimming pool or skating rink,) unit;  Customers shall only be permitted on the premises between the following hours:
06:00 - 23:00 Mondays -  Fridays and;
07:00 - 22:00 Saturdays, Sundays and Bank Holidays

Condition : 6 - If the premises is operating as a Class E(b) Sale of food and drink for consumption (mostly) on the premises unit;  Customers shall only be permitted on the premises between the following hours:
09:00 - 22:00 Sundays - Thursdays and;
09:00 - 23:00 Fridays - Saturdays.

Condition : 7 - If the premises is operating as a Class E(c) Financial services, Professional services (other than health or medical services), Other appropriate services in a commercial, business or service locality, Class E(e) Provision of medical or health services (except the use of premises attached to the residence of the consultant or practitioner) or E(g)(i) Offices to carry out any operational or administrative functions Customers shall only be permitted on the premises between the following hours:
08:00 - 20:00 Mondays - Fridays and;
09:00 - 17:00  Saturdays - Sundays.
